### 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 같은 비밀번호로 한 사람 더 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gaeun@example.com",
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 이미 가입한 이메일
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "another2026"
}

### 이메일이 숫자인 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": 2026,
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 짧은 비밀번호
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hyein@example.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 회원 목록
GET http://localhost:4011/members
